; THE ASHEN WILDS' GEOGRAPHY RECIPE.
;
; The same generator and master seed as the Ember Crown and Frostfang, and a third country. The Wilds
; are the Cataclysm scar: RUGGED rather than mountainous (a middling MountainPrevalence and height, but
; ErosionStrength well under the Crown's, because this ground has not had the time to be rounded off),
; DRY (a very high RiverThreshold, so the drainage solve cuts almost nothing - there is no water in the
; scar worth the name) and warm. SnowLine sits far above anything generated here.

